        "text": "Guys, I have an idea for a capstone project and I wanted to get your opinions.\n\nI want to pull price lists from the 3 big cloud providers (AWS, GCP and Azure) and create a dashboard where users can compare prices for different services across regions.\nExample: How much does the minimum instance (EC2, GCE, ACI) cost per hour across the world.\nThe use case I can think of here is as a tool to help plan out cloud infra for engineers looking to optimise cloud costs.",
